    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "An exceptional opportunity to rent a beautifully renovated three-bedroom terraced home in the heart of Gorey. Recently refurbished throughout to a very high standard, this impressive property is presented to the rental market unfurnished as a first letting and offers modern, stylish and comfortable accommodation in a superb central location.\n\nOn entering the property, you are greeted by a large, bright living room, complete with generous built-in understairs storage. To the rear is a superb bright and spacious kitchen, fully fitted with modern units and providing an excellent space for everyday living and entertaining.\n\nThe ground floor also benefits from a separate utility room and downstairs WC. Patio doors from the kitchen open directly onto a private, enclosed rear yard, which also benefits from private parking a particularly valuable feature in such a central location.\n\nUpstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms, each finished to a high standard and featuring built-in wardrobes. The accommodation is completed by a modern, stylish main bathroom.\n\nLocated on St Michaels Place in the heart of Gorey, the property is within easy reach of the town`s excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools and local amenities. Its central location also provides convenient access to public transport and the wider road network.\n\nThis is a turn-key, high-quality first letting that combines modern living with an exceptionally convenient town-centre location."
      },
